              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Petero aramwihererana atangira kumuhana ati “Biragatsindwa Mwami, ibyo ntibizakubaho na hato.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.16.22",
