              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arahindukira abwira Petero ati “Subira inyuma yanjye Satani, umbereye igisitaza kuko ibyo utekereza atari iby'Imana, ahubwo utekereza iby'abantu.”",
