              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndababwira ukuri yuko muri aba bahagaze hano harimo bamwe batazapfa, kugeza ubwo bazabona Umwana w'umuntu aziye mu bwami bwe.”",
          "type": "text",
